"color-2\">file</font></span>\n"
"            to share documents that are frequently needed\n"
"        </span>"
msgstr ""
"<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n"
"            Използвайте\n"
"            /<span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\"><font class=\"text-o-color-"
"2\">file</font></span>\n"
"            за да споделяте документи, които често са необходими\n"
"        </span>"

#. module: knowledge
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:knowledge.knowledge_article_user_onboarding
msgid ""
